# .audit-allow
# Intentional exceptions for the continuous-audit gate (audit.yml).
# One glob/pattern per line. Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Patterns are matched against changed file paths in PR diffs.
# Reference: audit program tracked in issue #3.

# Currently no intentional placeholders or tracked stubs are exempted.
# Add patterns here only after documenting the justification in the linked issue.
